{title: 268 - Holy Spirit, Light Divine}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Holy Spirit}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Ab]Holy [Eb]Spirit, [Ab]light divine,
[Ab]Shine [Bb7]upon [Eb/Bb]this [Ab]heart of mine,
[Ab]Chase [Dm]the [Eb]shades [Ab]of [Cm/G]night [Bbm]away,
[Fm]Turn [Gdim]my [Db/Ab]darkness [Ab]into [Gdim]day.

Verse 2:
[Ab]Holy [Eb]Spirit, [Ab]power [Gdim]divine,
[Ab]Cleanse [Bb7]this [Fm/C]guilty [Ab]heart of mine;
[Ab]Long [Dm]has [Eb]sin, [Fm/C]without [Bbm]control,
[Fm]Held [Gdim]dominion [Ab]o'er my [Gdim]soul.

Verse 3:
[Ab]Holy [Eb]Ghost, [Fm/C]with [Ab]joy divine,
[Ab]Cheer [Bb7]this [Fm/C]saddened [Ab]heart of mine,
[Ab]Bid [Dm]my [Eb]many [Cm/G]woes [Bbm]depart,
[Fm]Heal [Gdim]my [Db/Ab]wounded, [Ab]bleeding [Gdim]heart.

Verse 4:
[Ab]Holy [Eb]Spirit, [Ab]all divine,
[Ab]Dwell [Bb7]within [Eb/Bb]this [Ab]heart of mine,
[Ab]Cast [Dm]down [Eb]every [Cm/G]idol [Bbm]throne,
[Fm]Reign [Gdim]supreme, [Ab]and reign alone.
